B.a9U=new A.cn("n19","Rietveld refinement converged | with \u03c7\xb2 of 1.7 | and a weighted R-factor of 4.9%.")
B.a9O=new A.cn("n20","Single-atom alloys (SAA) | dissociated methane | without extensive coke formation.")
B.aa3=new A.cn("n21","Multiwalled carbon nanotubes grew | from coordinatively unsaturated | nickel step edges.")
B.a9V=new A.cn("n22","The double-layer capacitance was | 28 \u03bcF/cm\xb2 | in one molar potassium hydroxide.")
B.a9Y=new A.cn("n23","Selectivity toward ethylene | exceeded 71%, | whereas methane stayed below 3%.")
